 168</p></div><div class='cell'><svg viewBox='0 0 720 550' role='img' aria-label='Контур FGH'><g stroke='#4a5866' stroke-width='2.4' fill='none'><line x1='60' y1='500' x2='270' y2='500'/><line x1='270' y1='500' x2='543' y2='500'/><line x1='543' y1='500' x2='543' y2='290'/><line x1='543' y1='290' x2='543' y2='38'/><line x1='543' y1='38' x2='165' y2='38'/><line x1='165' y1='38' x2='60' y2='290'/><line x1='165' y1='38' x2='270' y2='290'/><line x1='60' y1='290' x2='270' y2='290'/><line x1='270' y1='290' x2='543' y2='290'/><line x1='60' y1='290' x2='60' y2='500'/><line x1='270' y1='500' x2='270' y2='290'/><line x1='543' y1='500' x2='643.7' y2='269'/><line x1='643.7' y1='269' x2='543' y2='38'/></g><g fill='#93a1b1' font-size='26' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='600'><text x='40' y='530'>A</text><text x='270' y='535'>B</text><text x='560' y='535'>C</text><text x='32' y='296'>G</text><text x='290' y='318'>H</text><text x='566' y='318'>I</text><text x='566' y='30'>E</text><text x='165' y='22'>F</text><text x='676' y='276'>D</text></g><path class='dr' pathLength='100' style='--d:0.2s;--dur:2s' stroke='#f0a83c' stroke-width='6' fill='none' stroke-linecap='round' stroke-linejoin='round' d='M165 38L60 290L270 290Z'/><text x='85' y='160' fill='#f0a83c' font-size='32' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='700' class='fi' style='--d:0.8s'>t</text><text x='165' y='275' fill='#f0a83c' font-size='32' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='700' class='fi' style='--d:1.3s'>s</text><text x='245' y='160' fill='#f0a83c' font-size='32' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='700' class='fi' style='--d:1.8s'>t</text></svg><p class='ccap'><b>(2)</b> P(FGH) = 108</p></div><div class='cell'><svg viewBox='0 0 720 550' role='img' aria-label='Контур BCEFH'><g stroke='#4a5866' stroke-width='2.4' fill='none'><line x1='60' y1='500' x2='270' y2='500'/><line x1='270' y1='500' x2='543' y2='500'/><line x1='543' y1='500' x2='543' y2='290'/><line x1='543' y1='290' x2='543' y2='38'/><line x1='543' y1='38' x2='165' y2='38'/><line x1='165' y1='38' x2='60' y2='290'/><line x1='165' y1='38' x2='270' y2='290'/><line x1='60' y1='290' x2='270' y2='290'/><line x1='270' y1='290' x2='543' y2='290'/><line x1='60' y1='290' x2='60' y2='500'/><line x1='270' y1='500' x2='270' y2='290'/><line x1='543' y1='500' x2='643.7' y2='269'/><line x1='643.7' y1='269' x2='543' y2='38'/></g><g fill='#93a1b1' font-size='26' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='600'><text x='40' y='530'>A</text><text x='270' y='535'>B</text><text x='560' y='535'>C</text><text x='32' y='296'>G</text><text x='290' y='318'>H</text><text x='566' y='318'>I</text><text x='566' y='30'>E</text><text x='165' y='22'>F</text><text x='676' y='276'>D</text></g><path class='dr' pathLength='100' style='--d:0.2s;--dur:2s' stroke='#f0a83c' stroke-width='6' fill='none' stroke-linecap='round' stroke-linejoin='round' d='M270 500L543 500L543 38L165 38L270 290Z'/><text x='406' y='480' fill='#f0a83c' font-size='32' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='700' class='fi' style='--d:0.8s'>t</text><text x='485' y='170' fill='#f0a83c' font-size='32' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='700' class='fi' style='--d:1.3s'>s + d</text><text x='354' y='74' fill='#f0a83c' font-size='32' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='700' class='fi' style='--d:1.8s'>s : 2 + t</text><text x='245' y='160' fill='#f0a83c' font-size='32' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='700' class='fi' style='--d:2.3s'>t</text><text x='300' y='400' fill='#f0a83c' font-size='32' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='700' class='fi' style='--d:2.8s'>s</text></svg><p class='ccap'><b>(3)</b> P(BCEFH) = 228</p></div></div><figcaption>Три данных контура — три уравнения. В (1) и (2) стоят только s и t, причём обе стороны крыши в обоих — это хвост 2t. Буква d появляется лишь в (3): через стенку CE = s + d.</figcaption></figure>",
 "Каждый спрошенный периметр — тоже обход": "<figure class='st fx'><div class='fgrid2'><div class='cell'><svg viewBox='0 0 720 550' role='img' aria-label='Контур ABHG'><g stroke='#4a5866' stroke-width='2.4' fill='none'><line x1='60' y1='500' x2='270' y2='500'/><line x1='270' y1='500' x2='543' y2='500'/><line x1='543' y1='500' x2='543' y2='290'/><line x1='543' y1='290' x2='543' y2='38'/><line x1='543' y1='38' x2='165' y2='38'/><line x1='165' y1='38' x2='60' y2='290'/><line x1='165' y1='38' x2='270' y2='290'/><line x1='60' y1='290' x2='270' y2='290'/><line x1='270' y1='290' x2='543' y2='290'/><line x1='60' y1='290' x2='60' y2='500'/><line x1='270' y1='500' x2='270' y2='290'/><line x1='543' y1='500' x2='643.7' y2='269'/><line x1='643.7' y1='269' x2='543' y2='38'/></g><g fill='#93a1b1' font-size='26' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='600'><text x='40' y='530'>A</text><text x='270' y='535'>B</text><text x='560' y='535'>C</text><text x='32' y='296'>G</text><text x='290' y='318'>H</text><text x='566' y='318'>I</text><text x='566' y='30'>E</text><text x='165' y='22'>F</text><text x='676' y='276'>D</text></g><path class='dr' pathLength='100' style='--d:0.2s;--dur:2s' stroke='#f0a83c' stroke-width='6' fill='none' stroke-linecap='round' stroke-linejoin='round' d='M60 500L270 500L270 290L60 290Z'/><text x='165' y='480' fill='#f0a83c' font-size='32' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='700' class='fi' style='--d:0.8s'>s</text><text x='300' y='400' fill='#f0a83c' font-size='32' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='700' class='fi' style='--d:1.3s'>s</text><text x='165' y='275' fill='#f0a83c' font-size='32' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='700' class='fi' style='--d:1.8s'>s</text><text x='38' y='400' fill='#f0a83c' font-size='32' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='700' class='fi' style='--d:2.3s'>s</text></svg><p class='ccap'><b>P(ABHG)</b> = s + s + s + s</p></div><div class='cell'><svg viewBox='0 0 720 550' role='img' aria-label='Контур CDE'><g stroke='#4a5866' stroke-width='2.4' fill='none'><line x1='60' y1='500' x2='270' y2='500'/><line x1='270' y1='500' x2='543' y2='500'/><line x1='543' y1='500' x2='543' y2='290'/><line x1='543' y1='290' x2='543' y2='38'/><line x1='543' y1='38' x2='165' y2='38'/><line x1='165' y1='38' x2='60' y2='290'/><line x1='165' y1='38' x2='270' y2='290'/><line x1='60' y1='290' x2='270' y2='290'/><line x1='270' y1='290' x2='543' y2='290'/><line x1='60' y1='290' x2='60' y2='500'/><line x1='270' y1='500' x2='270' y2='290'/><line x1='543' y1='500' x2='643.7' y2='269'/><line x1='643.7' y1='269' x2='543' y2='38'/></g><g fill='#93a1b1' font-size='26' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='600'><text x='40' y='530'>A</text><text x='270' y='535'>B</text><text x='560' y='535'>C</text><text x='32' y='296'>G</text><text x='290' y='318'>H</text><text x='566' y='318'>I</text><text x='566' y='30'>E</text><text x='165' y='22'>F</text><text x='676' y='276'>D</text></g><path class='dr' pathLength='100' style='--d:0.2s;--dur:2s' stroke='#f0a83c' stroke-width='6' fill='none' stroke-linecap='round' stroke-linejoin='round' d='M543 500L643.7 269L543 38Z'/><text x='628' y='410' fill='#f0a83c' font-size='32' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='700' class='fi' style='--d:0.8s'>d</text><text x='628' y='140' fill='#f0a83c' font-size='32' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='700' class='fi' style='--d:1.3s'>d</text><text x='485' y='170' fill='#f0a83c' font-size='32' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='700' class='fi' style='--d:1.8s'>s + d</text></svg><p class='ccap'><b>P(CDE)</b> = d + d + (s + d)</p></div><div class='cell'><svg viewBox='0 0 720 550' role='img' aria-label='Вся фигура'><g stroke='#4a5866' stroke-width='2.4' fill='none'><line x1='60' y1='500' x2='270' y2='500'/><line x1='270' y1='500' x2='543' y2='500'/><line x1='543' y1='500' x2='543' y2='290'/><line x1='543' y1='290' x2='543' y2='38'/><line x1='543' y1='38' x2='165' y2='38'/><line x1='165' y1='38' x2='60' y2='290'/><line x1='165' y1='38' x2='270' y2='290'/><line x1='60' y1='290' x2='270' y2='290'/><line x1='270' y1='290' x2='543' y2='290'/><line x1='60' y1='290' x2='60' y2='500'/><line x1='270' y1='500' x2='270' y2='290'/><line x1='543' y1='500' x2='643.7' y2='269'/><line x1='643.7' y1='269' x2='543' y2='38'/></g><g fill='#93a1b1' font-size='26' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='600'><text x='40' y='530'>A</text><text x='270' y='535'>B</text><text x='560' y='535'>C</text><text x='32' y='296'>G</text><text x='290' y='318'>H</text><text x='566' y='318'>I</text><text x='566' y='30'>E</text><text x='165' y='22'>F</text><text x='676' y='276'>D</text></g><path class='dr' pathLength='100' style='--d:0.2s;--dur:2s' stroke='#f0a83c' stroke-width='6' fill='none' stroke-linecap='round' stroke-linejoin='round' d='M60 500L543 500L643.7 269L543 38L165 38L60 290Z'/><text x='410' y='480' fill='#f0a83c' font-size='32' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='700' class='fi' style='--d:0.8s'>s + t</text><text x='628' y='410' fill='#f0a83c' font-size='32' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='700' class='fi' style='--d:1.3s'>d</text><text x='628' y='140' fill='#f0a83c' font-size='32' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='700' class='fi' style='--d:1.8s'>d</text><text x='354' y='74' fill='#f0a83c' font-size='32' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='700' class='fi' style='--d:2.3s'>s : 2 + t</text><text x='85' y='160' fill='#f0a83c' font-size='32' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='700' class='fi' style='--d:2.8s'>t</text><text x='38' y='400' fill='#f0a83c' font-size='32' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='700' class='fi' style='--d:3.3s'>s</text></svg><p class='ccap'><b>P(фигуры)</b> = (s + t) + d + d + (s : 2 + t) + t + s</p></div></div><figcaption>Три спрошенных контура. В CDE сторона E→C — вся вертикаль от земли до E, то есть s + d. У всей фигуры внутренние отрезки GH, HI, BH, FH и CE в обход не входят.</figcaption></figure>"
